This server is written with B4J tool(which creates native java jar. https://b4x.com/b4j.html ). It embeds a Jetty server(http and websocket), Jetty websocket client library is used to connect the R instances(shiny app).

More details will be available later.

Client <--(websocket)--> Jetty websocket thread (ws client) <--(websocket)--> shiny app
Client     <--(http)-->       Jetty http thread                                  <--(http)-->      shiny app

