Shiny uses another JavaScript software for creating sliders. You should make a feature request to the rangeSlider project <https://github.com/IonDen/ion.rangeSlider/issues>. If the developer accepts your request, it will become available through Shiny after Shiny is updated by its maintainer to use the new version of rangeSlider. You have an interesting use case, so the developer would be likely to agree to implement it himself.

